OL,5,G0000 Don't Tell the Doctor
OL,6,     FReality series. Kyran has a lump
OL,7,     Fabove his eye, Coco's attempts to
OL,8,     Fremove a scar made it worse, Sammi
OL,9,     Fhas extreme facial hair, and Luke
